    {
      "key": "t1d29dbbf8f6787cd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Rather than focusing on ownership, CFD-based trading emphasizes market participation. This structure aligns well with the fast-paced nature of Bitcoin markets, where global price activity remains continuous and highly liquid.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/bitcoin-cfd-trading-platform-in-uae-market-access-in-a-digital-economy#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/bitcoin-cfd-trading-platform-in-uae-market-access-in-a-digital-economy"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Em vez de focar na propriedade, a negociação por CFDs enfatiza a participação no mercado. Essa estrutura se ajusta ao ritmo acelerado dos mercados de Bitcoin, cuja atividade global de preços permanece contínua e altamente líquida.</span>"
    },
